					"content": "#旅行者！怎麼樣，{F#妳}{M#你}找到愛拉尼了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050802,
					"content": "找到是找到了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050823,
					"content": "向妮露法講述了事情的經過，並把愛拉尼的便條給了她…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 731050803,
					"content": "娜贊？怎麼會是她…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050804,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}認識她嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050805,
					"content": "嗯…也談不上認識，但我聽人提起過，她是一個很奇怪的盜寶團成員。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050806,
					"content": "據說，她劫掠行人的時候，會向被劫掠的人提一個問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050807,
					"content": "問題的範圍從文學到元素，亂七八糟的什麼都有，甚至…甚至還有那種「腦筋急轉彎」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050808,
					"content": "#無論如何，只要能解出娜贊的問題，那她不僅會把劫掠的東西全部奉還，還會親自護送{F#妳}{M#你}回城裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050809,
					"content": "她原來是這種怪人嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050810,
						731050811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050810,
					"content": "這是什麼謎語大盜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050812
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 731050812,
					"content": "沒人知道她有什麼目的。我之所以知道這件事，也是因為我的導師曾經在野外遇見過娜贊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050813,
					"content": "當時娜贊的問題是：「用什麼東西能夠迅速填滿一間空蕩蕩的屋子。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050814,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050815,
					"content": "風！對嗎？肯定對吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050816,
					"content": "呃…燭光？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050817
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 731050817,
					"content": "我導師的回答是：「元素力始終無處不在。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050818,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 731050819,
					"content": "耍賴！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050820,
					"content": "哈哈哈…總之，娜贊是把我的導師送回了城裡，還和他禮貌地道別。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050821,
					"content": "如果是她和愛拉尼在一起，我反倒不那麼擔心了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050822,
					"content": "但愛拉尼那孩子一直待在那裡也不行，我得想個辦法，幫她把論文的問題解決了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "妮露法"
				},
				{
					"id": 731050811,
					"content": "她到底有什麼目的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731050812
					]
				}
			]
		},
